WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.251
Assalomu alaykum.

2
00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:08.392
Bu darsda eng sodda, lekin eng ko‘p ishlatiladigan usul — o‘zgaruvchilarni ajratishni o‘rganamiz.

3
00:00:08.392 --> 00:00:11.631
Tarmoqda virus tarqalishi, choyning sovishi,

4
00:00:11.631 --> 00:00:16.637
radioaktiv yemirilish — bularning barchasi shu usul bilan yechiladi.

5
00:00:16.637 --> 00:00:24.734
Dars oxirida siz tenglamani yechibgina qolmay, bo‘lish paytida yo‘qolib qoladigan yechimlarni ham topa olasiz.

6
00:00:24.984 --> 00:00:34.200
Tenglama ajraladigan deyiladi, agar o‘ng tomon ikki ko‘paytuvchiga ajralsa: biri faqat x ga,

7
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.205
ikkinchisi faqat y ga bog‘liq.

8
00:00:37.205 --> 00:00:46.120
Unda y li hammasini chapga, x li hammasini o‘ngga o‘tkazamiz: d y ni g dan y ga bo‘lamiz,

9
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.726
u f dan x karra d x ga teng bo‘ladi.

10
00:00:49.726 --> 00:00:56.438
Keyin ikkala tomonni integrallaymiz va bitta o‘zgarmas C qo‘shamiz.

11
00:00:56.688 --> 00:01:01.110
Misol: y shtrix teng x karra y kvadrat.

12
00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:05.192
Bu yerda f teng x, g teng y kvadrat.

13
00:01:05.192 --> 00:01:11.088
Bo‘lishdan oldin muhim qadam: g ni nolga tenglaymiz.

14
00:01:11.088 --> 00:01:15.737
y kvadrat nolga teng bo‘lsa, y aynan nol.

15
00:01:15.737 --> 00:01:21.179
Tekshiramiz: chap tomon nol, o‘ng tomon ham nol.

16
00:01:21.179 --> 00:01:24.354
Demak, y aynan nol — yechim.

17
00:01:24.354 --> 00:01:27.302
Uni darhol yozib qo‘yamiz.

18
00:01:27.552 --> 00:01:36.365
Endi y nolga teng emas deb hisoblab, ajratamiz: d y ni y kvadratga bo‘lamiz, bu x karra d x ga teng.

19
00:01:36.365 --> 00:01:44.561
Chap tomonning integrali minus bir bo‘lingan y ga, o‘ng tomonniki x kvadratning yarmiga teng.

20
00:01:44.561 --> 00:01:46.852
Bitta o‘zgarmas qo‘shamiz.

21
00:01:46.852 --> 00:01:53.462
Natijada minus bir bo‘lingan y teng x kvadrat ikkiga bo‘lingan plyus C bir.

22
00:01:53.712 --> 00:02:01.591
y ni topamiz: y teng minus ikki bo‘lingan x kvadrat plyus C ga, bunda C ikki karra C bir.

23
00:02:01.591 --> 00:02:06.990
To‘liq javob ikki qismdan iborat: shu formula va y aynan nol.

24
00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:13.453
E’tibor bering, y aynan nol formuladan hech qanday chekli C da chiqmaydi.

25
00:02:13.453 --> 00:02:19.118
Agar uni oldindan yozmaganimizda, u butunlay yo‘qolgan bo‘lardi.

26
00:02:19.368 --> 00:02:21.854
Yo‘nalish maydoniga qaraymiz.

27
00:02:21.854 --> 00:02:32.140
Aynan y o‘qida x nol bo‘lgani uchun kesmalar gorizontal; y o‘qiga yaqin nuqtalarda esa ularning qiyaligi kichik bo‘ladi.

28
00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:37.454
Ox o‘qining o‘zi ham integral chiziq — bu y aynan nol yechimi.

29
00:02:37.454 --> 00:02:46.797
Yuqoridagi va pastdagi egri chiziqlar uni hech qachon kesib o‘tmaydi: yagonalik teoremasi shuni kafolatlaydi.

30
00:02:46.797 --> 00:02:51.254
Pastki egri chiziq C ikkiga teng bo‘lgandagi yechim.

31
00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:54.264
Endi o‘zingizni sinab ko‘ring.

32
00:02:54.264 --> 00:02:59.141
Ekrandagi tenglamaning o‘zgarmas yechimlarini toping.

33
00:02:59.141 --> 00:03:05.306
Eslatma: o‘ng tomonni nolga tenglang va har bir ildizni tekshiring.

34
00:03:05.306 --> 00:03:08.342
Javobni tanlagach, izohni o‘qing.
